  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Internal Audit Units for Effective Procurement Monitoring and Enforcement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with the agreement made between the Government and the donor agencies in order to attain sustainability of the internal audit reform, this IDF grant proposed to fund the following activites: a) quality assessment of internal audti function; (b) develop an internal audit manual with appropriate focus on procurement compliance review and reporting; c) training needs assessment; d) develop an effective and efficient procurement records management and monitoring system for national agencies; and e) strengthen the role of PAGC as the oversight agency in monitoring the performance of Internal Audit Service Units.</narrative>
  </description>
